  "title": "AFS Launches Inspiring Career Day to Empower Production Workforce",
  "summary": "To enhance career development opportunities for their production workforce, Advanced Flow Solutions (AFS) hosted their first Career Day event. Initiated by HR Leaders Aubrey and Brittany, the event reinforced employee benefits, current advancement opportunities and more. AFS President Mike Brown opened the event by reaffirming his dedication to investing in career development for his team. […]",
